    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our community</h1><p></p><br><h1>Also recommended for you</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479220/extras/7ad5a827cc23b585b58d96652c32df7e.poster.avif?t=1705613450\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479220/extras/7ad5a827cc23b585b58d96652c32df7e.webm?t=1705613450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479220/extras/7ad5a827cc23b585b58d96652c32df7e.mp4?t=1705613450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on a journey deep into the forest, in medieval times, in search of a princess locked away in a castle. Unravel puzzles based on the classic game Peg Solitaire, which will challenge you on this journey in search of the princess. Find your way to solve each challenge that will lead you closer to the red castle. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479220/extras/9a49f54f2aeadcb15b1312b4a80b71e1.poster.avif?t=1705613450\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479220/extras/9a49f54f2aeadcb15b1312b4a80b71e1.webm?t=1705613450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479220/extras/9a49f54f2aeadcb15b1312b4a80b71e1.mp4?t=1705613450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83e\udded Explore enchanting locations such as forests, ancient ruins and picturesque villages, each of which holds riddles to be deciphered.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83c\udfdeDazzle 12 landscapes, lovingly crafted and full of details.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\u265fUnravel +70 puzzles that stand in your way.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83c\udfb5Enjoy an exclusive soundtrack that will accompany you on your journey.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479220/extras/7c97c968ab3bf99b766602612212be95.poster.avif?t=1705613450\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479220/extras/7c97c968ab3bf99b766602612212be95.webm?t=1705613450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>",
