ll accompany you on your journey.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479220/extras/7c97c968ab3bf99b766602612212be95.poster.avif?t=1705613450\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479220/extras/7c97c968ab3bf99b766602612212be95.webm?t=1705613450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>",
